T1  - TwinCompass: A multi-criteria and hybrid reasoning decision support framework for Digital Twin engineering in Cyber–Physical Systems
AU  - Marah, Hussein
AU  - Tezel, Barış Tekin
AU  - Challenger, Moharram
AU  - Vangheluwe, Hans
