TY  - JOUR
T1  - Architectures of knowing: toward a theory of AI-augmented observability in enterprise knowledge systems
AU  - Toumi, Aissa
AU  - Fosso Wamba, Samuel
AU  - Hafsi, Mouaad
JO  - Journal of Knowledge Management
