T1  - Requirements engineering for low-code development (RE4LCD): an empirical study from Nordic and central Europe
AU  - Kedziora, Damian
AU  - Wnuk, Krzysztof
JO  - Information and Software Technology
VL  - 200
SP  - 108334
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/12/01/
